QUESTION: Across all 2024 Grand Prix races, how many laps did each driver lead? Count a lap as led when the driver's Position is 1 on that lap. Give the driver with the most laps led and their count.
== run 1 ==
  step 1 SQL: SELECT l.Driver, ds.full_name, COUNT(*) AS laps_led
FROM laps l
JOIN driver_seasons ds ON l.Driver = ds.driver_code AND ds.season = 2024
WHERE l.session = 'R' AND l.Position = 1
GROUP BY l.Driver, ds.full_name
ORDER BY laps_led DESC
LIMIT 10;
