steps=1 ANSWER: "**Laps led by each driver in the 2024 season**\n\n| Driver | Laps led |\n|--------|----------|\n| Max Verstappen | 559 |\n| Lando Norris | 271 |\n| Charles Leclerc | 172 |\n| George Russell | 137 |\n| Carlos Sainz | 134 |\n| Oscar Piastri | 123 |\n| Lewis Hamilton | 31 |\n| Esteban Ocon | 14 |\n| Sergio Perez | 1 |\n\n**Driver with the most laps led:** Max Verstappen – **559 laps**."
